  crossing identity (joint - sum) = -4.076e-10   (tolerance 1.0e-06)   VERIFIED
  rung 1  (F diag, Theta diag, Sigma free)   logL = -35.3395834000
  rung 2  (F free, Theta free, Sigma free)   logL = -19.7054340258

